WEBVTT

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:16.390
Gosh, Tarou-chan... You're always so cool!

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:28.610
I can't resist this anymore!

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:33.530
Aww! I was just getting to the good part!

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.500
Yuuno Arashiko?!

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:44.850
"Did you study for the mini-test?"

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:46.260
"Let's do our best"...?

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:47.980
And just who is this person?!

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:48.960
Mother!

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:53.580
I came here to spend some quality time with my beloved Tarou-san.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:54.970
But what is that?!

00:00:57.220 --> 00:00:59.480
They're all from Arashiko!

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:03.700
Could she be... after Tarou-san?!

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:06.670
Shizuka-san.

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:07.520
Yes!

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:09.350
We're going to remove her from the picture.

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:10.980
Of course!

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:16.760
Help!!

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:26.120
Chu-ru-Chu-Chu-Chu... YES!! Help U

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:32.350
Hey you lost boy, with a face full of despair

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:34.570
If you throw out the straw you're leaning on,

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:37.630
I guess that can't be helped either?

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.900
Fate is (straying away)

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:42.090
Being mean again today (going beserk)

00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:47.940
At least I want to be on your side, but what can I do?

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:51.020
NO!! Jesus crisis! Oh My God!

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:53.070
Try leaving it to me

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:55.230
YES!! Chu-ru-Chu-Chu-Chu Help U

00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:57.510
Just getting there is too weak,

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:00.090
get destroyed to nothing and then?

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:04.760
DNA is stubborn. Overdoing isn't allowed.

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:07.130
With 5 seconds remaining I ended it forcefully (right before)

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:09.350
Feeling like getting reborn? (no way)

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:14.170
If we do the hands-on-approach rehab; you'll go to HEAVEN ❤ !

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:16.490
Without even letting you say yes

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:18.770
With these hands

00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:22.650
I'll fix you up right away

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:27.240
A little fall in love feeling bigger than your presence is

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:32.170
making me unable to leave you alone with that miserable face.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:36.380
I made it a meeting to change your outlook on life.

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:41.450
So just start going along with the flow

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:44.550
I'm off to HELP YOU!

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:50.050
My Mayhem-Filled Home

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:52.980
Stop moving so slowly, you damned maggot!

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:57.680
You hardcore, masochistic soldier...!

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:00.180
Please...

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:02.940
How many times do I have to tell you that you're supposed to get to the prone?

00:03:02.940 --> 00:03:04.350
You wimp of a soldier!

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:07.040
I-It's impossible!

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.100
It's not impossible!

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:12.910
If, by military-style training, you were to gain the spirit that can't even lose to your masochism,

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:15.910
then your disease would be cured immediately.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.180
Ain't I awesome?

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:18.790
Wha-

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:24.820
What the hell do you think you're looking at?!

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:28.440
Insulting your superiors is against the Military Law!

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:30.590
Start over!

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:39.460
Hey! Don't keep your superiors waiting!

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:42.260
Hurry the fuck up and crawl over here!

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:44.270
H-How can you expect me to do that...?

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:48.330
A-And why are there land mines everywhere?!

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.040
Don't talk back to me!

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:52.280
You maggot, pig-boy, pig-boy-maggot!

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:55.200
A pig-boy-maggot? That's going a bit too far!

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:00.770
Oh, my... Those eyes that look down upon the filthy me.

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:02.830
If I can make it there...

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:07.960
Superior Isurugi!

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:12.780
I, Pig-boy, have made it alive all the way to your feet!

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:14.560
Good job, Pig-boy.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:17.760
As a reward, I will massage you with my foot.

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:22.390
Ah! The sole of your foot... It feels so good!

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:25.150
You perversion allergen.

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:28.440
There's no possible way we can cure you of your masochism, fucker.

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:32.480
Gonna go fly at the speed of light.

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:36.950
Time to receive my prize!

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.580
What a... pervert...

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:40.900
Mio-sama!

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:42.280
You fucking creep!

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.780
You're just a tiny maggot!

00:04:52.880 --> 00:05:03.140
Is it possible that... you were getting excited by the mere thought of my feet rubbing your stomach against the ground?

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:06.540
Bullseye, eh?

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:08.610
What are we going to do with you?

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:14.160
Oh look, you've even got your "nasty juice"
all over Mio-sama's fingers.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:19.720
How do you plan on taking responsibility if I were infected by your perversions?

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:24.620
Oh? Your face looks like you're about to go to heaven.

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:26.610
You're such a creep.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:29.200
I'm at a lost for words; this is just pathetic.

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:31.130
You damned, perverted Pig-boy.

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:36.790
As punishment for your actions, I expect you to do 1,000 push-ups!

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:37.840
What?!

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:40.810
Though, it'd be boring if they were plain old push-ups.

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:43.850
I know <i>exactly</i>  how to make this punishment interesting.

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:49.850
Instead of adding weights, I'll just sit atop you.

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:53.050
Though I may be a bit too light for you, anyway!

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:57.150
Th-This... this situation...

00:05:58.160 --> 00:05:58.610
A horse?!!

00:05:58.610 --> 00:06:00.030
Just like a horse!
A horse?!!

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:06.440
Hey! Who the hell told you to gallop?!

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:10.080
Don't tell me you're...

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:11.960
Hey!!!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:13.750
You ass!

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:16.570
Yeehaw!

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:21.090
Even for me, that was a bit much...

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:24.770
Don't tell me you plan on training in this filthy room, too?

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:27.140
Call it the "Tactical Meeting Room"!

00:06:27.140 --> 00:06:28.530
Medic!

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:30.900
Yes!

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:33.620
Yuuno?!

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.010
That outfit...

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:36.080
Actually, you see...

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:38.880
The Angel of the Battlefield is the nurse, isn't it?

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:41.490
Hey, you shouldn't be forced to do this, especially if you don't want to.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.050
How rude.

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:45.790
You're making it sound like I <i>forced</i>  her to wear it.

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:48.470
Yeah, I was the one that wanted to wear it.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.160
What?

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:52.770
I always loved nurse uniforms...

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:56.700
But I'm not as pretty as Mio-san, so...

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.120
It's a bit odd, isn't it?

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:02.590
N-No... That's not true at all...

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:03.990
Really...?

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:05.510
Do I look good in it?

00:07:05.510 --> 00:07:07.440
Yeah, you do.

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:09.710
Hey, Pig-boy.

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:11.810
What about me? Do I look good, too?

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:13.540
Definitely.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:14.550
In your own way.

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:17.190
Hey, what's with the sudden change in attitude?!

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:21.310
But seriously, Nurse Arashiko sure is cute!

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:25.810
In fact, she's <i>too</i>  good for the likes of you, Pig-boy.

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:27.400
Oh, come on.

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:30.320
O-Okay then... we'll now get started with your physical.

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:31.690
Or something...

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:38.130
Yuuno?!

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:43.450
I'M SO SORRY, BUT MEN SCARE ME!

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:45.260
Oh God, YES!

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:48.480
I guess this is what intensive care means!

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:50.360
And, yet again, we've failed.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:52.920
How on Earth is this perverted freak ever going to change?

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:55.020
Keep hitting me!

00:07:55.020 --> 00:07:55.900
Goddammit!

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:57.480
Clench your teeth, will ya?!

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:01.790
I'll be going home from here now!

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:08.120
I'm home.

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:10.710
Wh-What happened to you, Tarou-chan?!

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:12.620
We'll talk later! For now, go take a bath!

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:14.070
Please, take it off. Hurry, hurry!

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:15.900
It's okay, I can do it myself.

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:17.620
I'm gonna take my clothes off, too!

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:17.630
What?
I'm gonna take my clothes off, too!

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:18.620
What?

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:21.970
What are you doing?!

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:23.790
We're going to bathe together!

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:25.550
I can join too, right?

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:27.220
Get the hell out!

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:30.430
Tarou-san, you're so mean!

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:32.920
Target item, hijacked.

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:35.180
We did it, Shizuka-san!

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:37.900
The Mail Check of Love...

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:42.430
"Before"?!

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.860
And it's from Arashiko again, too!

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:58.490
Oh, it's from Tarou!

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.010
What should I do?

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:22.880
Who could it be on a holiday?

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:26.730
Yuuno?!

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:28.950
I-I came to visit.

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:30.310
How are you feeling?

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:30.340
What do you mean?
How are you feeling?

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:31.440
What do you mean?

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:34.330
You caught a cold because of me, didn't you?

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:36.720
I'm so sorry!

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.670
As you can see, I'm doing fine.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:42.470
But I got a text from you...

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:43.420
A text?

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:45.530
Oh, is it a friend?

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:48.430
Welcome!

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:49.670
Sis?!

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:49.680
Mom?!
Sis?!

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:50.880
Mom?!

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:55.000
Tarou-chan is mine!

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.310
Spit it out, what kind of relationship are you two in?!

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:00.910
Crap... If they find out about Yuuno's condition...

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:02.280
U-Um!

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:04.210
Tarou! I mean...

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:08.120
I'm Sado Tarou-kun's classmate, Yuuno Arashiko.

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:09.540
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.550
Oh, no, the pleasure is all ours.

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:12.280
Huh?!

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:16.640
Thank you for always helping Tarou out.

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:18.250
I am his mother, Tomoko.

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:21.410
And I'm his older sister, Shizuka.

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:23.290
I hope we can get along, Yuuno-san!

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:27.210
What's happening here...?

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:28.880
This situation...

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:32.060
M-Me too, I hope we can get along!

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:33.920
What are you doing, Tarou-san?

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:36.190
Please let Yuuno-san inside.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:39.800
Oh, yeah. Please, come in.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:42.160
O-Okay, thank you very much.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:46.030
Welcome...

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:51.490
To the Hell-House...

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:06.080
I'm feeling pretty nervous.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:07.670
Um...

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:10.640
Is there anything I can help you with?

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:12.460
Just make yourself at home, Yuuno.

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:13.910
You're our guest, after all.

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:14.710
But...

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:17.050
Tarou-san, could you please pass me a plate?

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:17.680
Sure.

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:20.810
I want you to help me out next!

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:22.190
Okay, okay.

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:23.860
Is this fine?

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:25.630
Thank you, Tarou-san.

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:27.380
Could you please carry this?

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:28.030
Sure.

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:31.320
We can manage the rest on our own.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:32.590
You sure?

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:34.180
Well, just ask if you need any more help.

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:36.030
How nice...

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:42.060
Whoa...

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:44.030
The food looks amazing!

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:46.840
Okay, dig in!

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:48.350
Thank you very much.

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:50.740
And we still have tons more left if you want extra!

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:51.460
Okay!

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:55.840
Hey, is it always this prestigious in your home?

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:58.180
Nah... not really.

00:11:58.180 --> 00:12:00.730
Shizuka-san, it's working.

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:03.190
Time to put phase two in motion...

00:12:03.190 --> 00:12:05.040
So, Yuuno-san...

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:07.760
There's no need to hold back. Eat to your heart's content!

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:07.780
Okay, thank you for the food!
There's no need to hold back. Eat to your heart's content!

00:12:07.780 --> 00:12:09.640
Okay, thank you for the food!

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:15.070
This is really good!

00:12:15.070 --> 00:12:17.760
Oh, really? Thank you very much!

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:20.920
I'm glad it suits your taste.

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:24.960
I'm very impressed, seeing as how I cannot cook for myself.

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:28.590
With practice, I'm sure you'd be able to make something as simple as this in no time!

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:30.310
What the hell's going on...?

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:35.590
They usually get annoying and really hyped up whenever I'm involved...

00:12:35.590 --> 00:12:37.070
Then do you want to cook together next time?

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:38.890
I thought they'd kick her out of the house, but...

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:40.760
Yeah! That's a great idea!

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:42.380
I can't believe it.

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:46.230
Hey, Yuuno-san, what kind of relationship are you in with Tarou-chan?

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:48.160
W-Well...

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:51.950
We're in the same class and the same club.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.240
Oh, and we also walk together on our way back from school.

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:56.690
Yuuno! You just stepped on a land mine!

00:12:56.690 --> 00:13:00.120
Is that so? It sounds like you two are lovers, then!

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:00.990
What?

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:04.410
Could you two perhaps already be dating?

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:08.380
Th-That's... Well, not yet...

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:11.990
So then, something like... waiting for it to happen?

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:18.140
What the...? What's with this unusually normal conversation...?

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:19.320
If it's someone nice like you, Yuuno-san, I feel relieved as a parent.

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:20.760
Is this a dream?

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:21.450
If it's someone nice like you, Yuuno-san, I feel relieved as a parent.

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:23.550
No. Could they have...

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:29.440
Could they have finally arisen as a normal family?!

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:34.900
I'm not sad, but tears are pouring out of my eyes!

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:39.430
Tarou, what's wrong?

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:46.170
It's a little different from our rehearsal with the dolls.

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:49.330
It nearly took my soul...

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:52.110
Looks like there's no choice but to move onto phase three!

00:13:52.110 --> 00:13:53.460
It's prepared already!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:03.930
Oh, I probably will never forget...

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:06.030
Today, this vibrant day!

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:10.360
Thank you, Yuuno.

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:11.520
Thank you, world!

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:16.030
You weirdo!

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.170
Here, please come in.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:19.790
Wha-

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:22.700
What the hell is this?!

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:25.350
What's with this pigsty...

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:27.780
This is, uh... How can I say this...?

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:28.650
All right!

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:33.340
I may not be able to cook, but I'm definitely good at cleaning.

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:34.590
Yuuno?

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:37.260
What's wrong?

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:38.700
That!

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:45.050
T-T-Tarou... d-do you... like this kind of thing?

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:45.890
No way!

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:48.910
E-E-Even if you like muscles, I wouldn't...

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:50.590
This is all a big misunderstanding!

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:56.950
Y-You have these interests too...?

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:57.480
No!

00:14:57.480 --> 00:15:00.220
I don't remember collecting any of this!

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:12.750
The tea... is cold now...

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:14.350
Yeah...

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:19.060
Should I make some more?

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:20.890
No, it's okay.

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:25.110
I'm really sorry about everything that's happened.

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:27.110
Don't worry about it.

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:28.870
